	"descriptionMarkdown": "<p>An early-game ship for the inner planets, built with Nauvis tech only.</p>\n\n<p>For flights between [space-location=nauvis] Nauvis, [space-location=vulcanus] Vulcanus, [space-location=gleba] Gleba and [space-location=fulgora] Fulgora.</p>\n\n<p><b>How to use it:</b> give the ship a single station, the planet it serves (Nauvis in the picture, with unloading on). In the hub, add one logistic group per planet, for example \"Vulcanus to Nauvis\" with its items imported from Vulcanus. When one of them runs out, the ship's interrupts send it to that planet until all requests are satisfied (or 2 minutes), then it flies back and unloads. Use the same logistic groups on the cargo landing pad of the planet it serves, so the pad and the ship always ask for the same items.</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/3CDKyUy\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:8px 18px;background:#2b7de9;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none\">📷 See the schedule and requests setup</a></p>\n\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=cargo-bay] <b>Cargo:</b> the hub keeps only ammo, plates and one stack of ore, so about 170 slots stay free for cargo. An alert shows when the hub is almost full.</li>\n  <li>[item=space-platform-hub] <b>Interrupt schedule:</b> request an item from a planet in the hub and the ship flies there to pick it up.</li>\n  <li>[item=firearm-magazine] <b>Ammo safety:</b> the ship leaves a planet only with 300 or more magazines and stops its thrusters if ammo runs low. You can rocket up magazines to shorten the first start.</li>\n  <li>[item=thruster] <b>Fuel saving:</b> a pump throttles the thrusters to a steady ~145 km/s.</li>\n  <li>[item=solar-panel] <b>Power:</b> solar only, safe to park at any inner planet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=space-platform-hub] Nauvis tech only. Build it in Nauvis orbit.</li>\n  <li>[item=automation-science-pack] Research: physical damage 5, weapon shooting speed 6, inserter capacity bonus 7.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Specs and stats</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li>[item=space-platform-foundation] <b>Size:</b> 654 tiles, 171 t, 3 thrusters, 8 gun turrets, 6 cargo bays.</li>\n  <li>[item=firearm-magazine] <b>First start:</b> about 16 minutes from paste until it leaves Nauvis with 300 magazines.</li>\n  <li>[item=thruster] <b>Flight Nauvis to Vulcanus:</b> about 102 seconds, average speed ~144 km/s.</li>\n  <li>[space-location=vulcanus] <b>Round trip Nauvis - Vulcanus with a 5 minute stop:</b> 531 seconds at best, 569 on average.</li>\n  <li>[item=gun-turret] <b>Reliability:</b> tested to take no damage with the research above, in flight and parked.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h3>Release notes</h3>\n<p><b>2026-11-03: First release</b></p>\n",
